OL,3,GNEWSAVictim of suspected caravan murder
OL,4,Awas a 'kind mum'
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe family of a woman whose body was
OL,7,Ffound in a caravan has paid tribute to
OL,8,Fa "caring and incredibly kind mum who
OL,9,Floved to laugh".
OL,11,FSusan Lumsden, 62, was discovered at
OL,12,FOverstone Lakes holiday park in Sywell,
OL,13,Fnear Northampton, on Monday morning
OL,14,Ffollowing reports of an assault.
OL,16,FPolice arrested a 72-year-old man on
OL,17,Fsuspicion of murder and have appealed
OL,18,Ffor witnesses or information.
OL,23,APub: 28-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
