OL,4,Awas a 'kind mum'
OL,5,
OL,6,F"Mum was a beautiful person inside and
OL,7,Fout ` fun, bubbly, caring and
OL,8,Fincredibly kind," said Ms Lumsden's
OL,9,Ffamily.
